                          },
                          "description": {
                            "value": "You create a pattern of shifting colors that hovers in the air in a geometric cloud. Creatures are dazzled while inside the pattern. In addition, a creature must attempt a Will saving throw if it is inside the pattern when you cast it, when it enters the pattern, when it ends its turn within the pattern, or if it uses a Seek or Interact action on the pattern. A creature currently fascinated by the pattern doesn't attempt new saves.\n\n- **Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The target is fascinated by the pattern.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is fascinated by the pattern. While it remains fascinated, it can't use reactions."
